## THE WALL

**THIRTEEN WALL EVENTS AT ONE CALIBER, AND NONE WAS RERUN.** The caliber was
`GHCRTS="-A64m -I0 -M8g"` on the pane, set by the program and untouched. Twelve
runs print `Heap exhausted; Current maximum heap size is 8589934592 bytes` and
one was killed by the operating system at 10.86 GB resident. **The first is the
probe's own first form**, which carried the successor step: 246.03 s,
`runs/full-0.out`. The other twelve are the controls below. Every one of them
is a DIFFERENT file, and each was written to remove one suspect.

| control | what is in it | result |
|---|---|---|
| `runs/Control565a.agda` | the step arithmetic, cured | exit 0, **0.69 s**, 268 MB |
| `runs/Control565b.agda` | the probe minus the transport | WALL, 258.15 s |
| `runs/Control565c.agda` | the successor step, `seq` route | WALL, 239.61 s |
| `runs/Control565d.agda` | its re-ascription alone | WALL, 236.56 s |
| `runs/Control565e.agda` | the same with the stage taken out | WALL, 234.95 s |
| `runs/Control565f.agda` | **control e with no delta step** | exit 0, **1.71 s** |
| `runs/Control565g.agda` | the bridge by the uniqueness law | WALL, 234.84 s |
| `runs/Control565h.agda` | the engine, other spelling, unabbreviated | WALL, 249.12 s |
| `runs/Control565i.agda` | one delta on `HierBelow`, at a variable | exit 0, **1.71 s** |
| `runs/Control565j.agda` | the same at `sucV α` | exit 0, **1.75 s** |
| `runs/Control565k.agda` | control h minus its last row | WALL, 237.38 s |
| `runs/Control565l.agda` | the bridge alone | KILLED at 10.86 GB, 200.23 s |
| `runs/Control565m.agda` | the engine with a local abbreviation | WALL, 239.19 s |
| `runs/Control565n.agda` | the hierarchy's spec at a successor | exit 0, **1.71 s** |
| `runs/Control565o.agda` | the imported engine, re-ascribed | exit 0, **1.71 s** |
| `runs/Control565p.agda` | the engine at the site, directions as hypotheses | exit 0, **1.79 s** |
| `runs/Control565q.agda` | `out` alone | exit 0, **1.67 s** |
| `runs/Control565r.agda` | `into` alone, domain inferred | exit 0, **1.67 s** |
| `runs/Control565s.agda` | the transport by `isProp→PathP` | WALL, 278.51 s |
| `runs/Control565t.agda` | the transport by the uniqueness law | WALL, 238.81 s |
